Resolves 3 CodeRabbit Major threads on PR #366:
- pr-pull.js: computeVerdict failed SonarCloud cognitive-complexity (26>15).
  Decomposed into per-rank pure predicates (rankUnknown/rankConflict/rankBehind/
  rankChecks/rankThreads/rankReviewPending/rankClean) + buildVerdictContext;
  computeVerdict is now a thin precedence dispatch loop. Behaviour identical —
  the full verdict precedence + fail-closed test suite still passes.
- pr-state-adapter.js: added adapter-level unit tests for readReviews (GraphQL
  request, pagination, latest-review-per-author with commitOid) and
  readHeadCommitTime (committedDate parse + null on invalid/unreadable).
- pr-pull.js: removed redundant `void _err;` from all catch blocks (SonarCloud
  build-failure noise); eslint caughtErrorsIgnorePattern already ignores `_err`.

Issues: c01936be, 35ee8d78

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
